{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Amethyst is a hack-and-slash action-adventure game where you roleplay as a dragon on a journey to uncover mysteries and secrets, build and protect your dragon lair for shelter, and conquer enemy strongholds with your resources. Trapped on a mysterious island after an accident, you find yourself drawn into a conflict filled with both internal and external struggles. Your unique dragon adventure awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced combat with various burst actions and combat support spawns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842690/extras/571ba11b109b0e0c8693e2b850d47435.poster.avif?t=1753106435\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842690/extras/571ba11b109b0e0c8693e2b850d47435.webm?t=1753106435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842690/extras/571ba11b109b0e0c8693e2b850d47435.mp4?t=1753106435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world as a dragon \u2014 your combat abilities include not only fiery breath, but also wielding weapons like swords, spears, and hammers to attack enemies in fast-paced combat. Along your journey, you'll also learn various burst-style combat actions that make each fight more dynamic and engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842690/extras/12b441e37820008c455383daacefd965.poster.avif?t=1753106435\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842690/extras/12b441e37820008c455383daacefd965.webm?t=1753106435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842690/extras/12b441e37820008c455383daacefd965.mp4?t=1753106435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various environment interaction via mystic power or mechanisms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842690/extras/d016bef41c36f339be95193be7f03d9b.poster.avif?t=1753106435\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842690/extras/d016bef41c36f339be95193be7f03d9b.webm?t=1753106435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842690/extras/d016bef41c36f339be95193be7f03d9b.mp4?t=1753106435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On an island filled with mysterious purple crystals, you can harness their power for environmental interactions, quest solving, or combat support effects. Every force is yours to control \u2014 but be careful, nothing comes without a cost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own dragon lair, defend it from enemy invasions, or become the invader and raid other lairs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842690/extras/cf6feb04cd6655a5c245b44778d2dfc6.poster.avif?t=1753106435\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842690/extras/cf6feb04cd6655a5c245b44778d2dfc6.webm?t=1753106435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842690/extras/cf6feb04cd6655a5c245b44778d2dfc6.mp4?t=1753106435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a typical dragon, you're drawn to creating your own home \u2014 your dragon lair. Along your journey, you can gather resources, discover construction blueprints, and build your lair from the ground up. But it's not just about building \u2014 you're living in an unpredictable environment filled with lurking dangers. You must design your lair to defend itself while you're away. Or, gather resources and rise as a Dragon Overlord, invading the lairs of others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world and explore the tiny world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842690/extras/9c32d64c02fff47a8461c996e9f4374c.poster.avif?t=1753106435\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842690/extras/9c32d64c02fff47a8461c996e9f4374c.webm?t=1753106435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842690/extras/9c32d64c02fff47a8461c996e9f4374c.mp4?t=1753106435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does size matter? Of course it does. You can explore the world in your normal size, grow to an enormous XXL form, or shrink down to a tiny XXXXS size \u2014 and who knows, you might even discover your lair hidden in those tiny spaces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape from the adventure to farm, fishing, or just enjoy your dragon life</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842690/extras/35da8c0f014908ae9e39420043fae084.poster.avif?t=1753106435\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842690/extras/35da8c0f014908ae9e39420043fae084.webm?t=1753106435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842690/extras/35da8c0f014908ae9e39420043fae084.mp4?t=1753106435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of combat and adventure? No problem \u2014 just take a step back, grab your fishing rod, or visit your places and enjoy the cozy life of a cute dragon through fishing, farming, building, and other relaxing activities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3842690?t=1753106435","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3842690?t=1753106435","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842690/291dc8c0c75cd9076715e42085237ef873a7bc73/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753106435","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842690/291dc8c0c75cd9076715e42085237ef873a7bc73/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753106435","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Amethyst is a hack-and-slash action-adventure game where you roleplay as a dragon on a journey to uncover mysteries and secrets, build and protect your dragon lair for shelter, and conquer enemy strongholds with your resources. Trapped on a mysterious island after an accident, you find yourself drawn into a conflict filled with both internal and external struggles. Your unique dragon adventure awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</