r resources and rise as a Dragon Overlord, invading the lairs of others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world and explore the tiny world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842690/extras/9c32d64c02fff47a8461c996e9f4374c.poster.avif?t=1753106435\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842690/extras/9c32d64c02fff47a8461c996e9f4374c.webm?t=1753106435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842690/extras/9c32d64c02fff47a8461c996e9f4374c.mp4?t=1753106435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does size matter? Of course it does. You can explore the world in your normal size, grow to an enormous XXL form, or shrink down to a tiny XXXXS size \u2014 and who knows, you might even discover your lair hidden in those tiny spaces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape from the adventure to farm, fishing, or just enjoy your dragon life</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842690/extras/35da8c0f014908ae9e39420043fae084.poster.avif?t=1753106435\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842690/extras/35da8c0f014908ae9e39420043fae084.webm?t=1753106435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842690/extras/35da8c0f014908ae9e39420043fae084.mp4?t=1753106435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of combat and adventure? No problem \u2014 just take a step back, grab your fishing rod, or visit your places and enjoy the cozy life of a cute dragon through fishing, farming, building, and other relaxing activities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Paradoxicat Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842690/c217ec845dbdf28f5026413d1b88bc88831b701c/header.jpg?t=1753106435","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3842690/2113101786/37eb01ae147e1f09703e6e0002768a49bb306fce/1751290469/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753106430","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3842690/2113101786/37eb01ae147e1f09703e6e0002768a49bb306fce/1751290469/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753106430","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3842690/2113101786/37eb01ae147e1f09703e6e0002768a49bb306fce/1751290469/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753106430","id":257163429,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257163429/movie480.mp4?t=1753106430","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257163429/movie_max.mp4?t=1753106430"},"name":"Combat Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257163429/933850e1acf2c78cbe9480ed06341b2b220d9fc1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753106430","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257163429/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753106430","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257163429/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1753106430"}},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3842690/617080139/f7e250f3d6a1977deff268319a0eeaa3a49b2782/1751291030/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753106433","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3842690/617080139/f7e250f3d6a1977deff268319a0eeaa3a49b2782